# Make the D1 dexterous hand perform a finger "dance": a rhythmic open/close
# wiggle across all fingers for the requested duration, then return to open.
# Request: how long to dance (optional; empty = default 3 s).
# Response: whether the dance ran, plus a human-readable message.
string duration_s   # optional: how long to dance, in seconds (e.g. "5"); empty = default 3 s
---
bool ok             # true if the dance ran to completion
string message      # human-readable status / error detail
